{"id":"978bb51599bc5702","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cantor-measure.md","title":"Cantor 概率测度","display":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cantor-measure","aliases":["20-df-cantor-measure"],"display":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度","chapter":"11","section":"11.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§11.1 的 measure 定义","source_pdf_pages":[220],"source_printed_pages":[189],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cantor-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cantor-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-measure — Cantor 概率测度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§11.1 的 measure 定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>220</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>189</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho,\\tau\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\rho=\\tau]\">\\(\\forall\\rho,\\tau\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\rho=\\tau]\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> 是实数闭区间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\">\\(m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\)</span> 为候选函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_2\">\\(\\mathcal B_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prob}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Prob}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 由下文定义。有限实数和、上确界和函数图采用基础集合论中的通常形式运算；测度的定义域明确为 Borel 集，不延伸为对任意子集的全函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal B_2:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega):\n2^\\omega\\in\\mathcal B\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\ [2^\\omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal B])\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\\n(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\in\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nm\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\land m(\\varnothing)=0\\land m(2^\\omega)=1\\\\\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B_2^\\omega\\\n\\Bigl[(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\ [i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing])\n\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ [\\sum_{n&lt;N}m(E_n)\\le m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists N\\in\\omega\\\n[m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)&lt;\\sum_{n&lt;N}m(E_n)+\\varepsilon]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [m([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}],\\\\\n\\exists!m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\ \\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m),\\\\\n\\mu:=\\bigcup\\{m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}:\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}:=\n\\sup\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in F}2^{-|\\sigma|}:F\\subseteq S\\land |F|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal B_2:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega):\n2^\\omega\\in\\mathcal B\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\ [2^\\omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal B])\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\\n(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\in\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nm\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\land m(\\varnothing)=0\\land m(2^\\omega)=1\\\\\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B_2^\\omega\\\n\\Bigl[(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\ [i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing])\n\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ [\\sum_{n&lt;N}m(E_n)\\le m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists N\\in\\omega\\\n[m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)&lt;\\sum_{n&lt;N}m(E_n)+\\varepsilon]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [m([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}],\\\\\n\\exists!m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\ \\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m),\\\\\n\\mu:=\\bigcup\\{m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}:\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}:=\n\\sup\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in F}2^{-|\\sigma|}:F\\subseteq S\\land |F|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原公平 Bernoulli 测度没有更换；其 Borel 定义域、可数可加性、柱集概率和唯一选取现在在 Assertion 中展开。候选 σ 代数构成集合且非空，包含整个幂集这一候选；因此交集有明确载体。柱集上的一致概率给出唯一 Borel 概率测度。</p>\n<p>前缀自由条件使柱集两两不交。对可能为空或无限的 S，以有限子和的上确界解释原求和记号，不依赖未给出的 S 枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.1 的 measure 定义；印刷页 189；PDF 第 220 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\rho,\\tau\\in S\\ [\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\rho=\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prob}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal B_2:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega):\n2^\\omega\\in\\mathcal B\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\sigma]\\in\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\ [2^\\omega\\setminus E\\in\\mathcal B])\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\\n(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n\\in\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nm\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\land m(\\varnothing)=0\\land m(2^\\omega)=1\\\\\n\\land\\forall(E_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal B_2^\\omega\\\n\\Bigl[(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\ [i\\ne j\\Rightarrow E_i\\cap E_j=\\varnothing])\n\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ [\\sum_{n<N}m(E_n)\\le m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)]\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\ \\exists N\\in\\omega\\\n[m(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n)<\\sum_{n<N}m(E_n)+\\varepsilon]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Prob}_2(m)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [m([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}],\\\\\n\\exists!m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}\\ \\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m),\\\\\n\\mu:=\\bigcup\\{m\\in[0,1]^{\\mathcal B_2}:\\operatorname{CantorMeasure}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}:=\n\\sup\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in F}2^{-|\\sigma|}:F\\subseteq S\\land |F|<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|},\\qquad\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]\\right)=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2978,"backlinks":[{"id":"58f8766635c79a79","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ml-measure-one]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"4da300de847d0dba","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"323381492f97cb49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"461236997f41a313","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"3e87bcedc6718afa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"d07bc20b7cf43ad2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-tail-shift]]；see [[20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover]]；see [[20-thm-prefix-product-measure]]。"},{"id":"5950e7607222bb8e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"58aed4b78aae5919","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-cor-positive-class-random-member]]。"},{"id":"6012ed8c9d9b861e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-prefix-products]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]] — 章 11；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]"}],"outgoing":["ef101d71722ee067"]}